  "final_message": "I cannot perform a breaking rename of `totalCents` to `amountCents` and `placedAt` to `createdAt` on [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L26) because it violates architecture rule **ARCH-4** in [GEMINI.md](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/GEMINI.md#L27).\n\n### Reason\n- **External Consumer Contract**: [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L26) events are consumed by external downstream services in separate repositories (`billing-service` and `analytics-ingest`).\n- **ARCH-4 Policy**: *\"No change may break a deployed consumer: changes are additive; renames and removals go through deprecation.\"* A direct rename/removal of `totalCents` and `placedAt` would break deployed consumers.\n\n---\n\n### ARCH-4 Compliant Approach: Additive Migration with Deprecation\n\nTo align with the Payments and Customer APIs while adhering to **ARCH-4**, the change must be **additive**:\n\n1. **Add new fields** `amountCents` and `createdAt` to [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L26).\n2. **Retain existing fields** `totalCents` and `placedAt` marked with `@deprecated`.\n3. **Populate both sets of fields** in [`orderPlaced()`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L42-L59) during the deprecation period to ensure existing consumers (`billing-service`, `analytics-ingest`) continue functioning uninterrupted while new consumers can adopt the updated naming.\n\n#### Proposed Schema ([`src/core/events.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L26))\n```ts\nexport interface OrderPlaced {\n  readonly type: \"OrderPlaced\";\n  readonly schemaVersion: 3;\n  readonly orderId: string;\n  readonly customerId: string;\n  readonly customerEmail: string;\n  /** ISO-8601 instant. */\n  readonly createdAt: string;\n  /** @deprecated Renamed to `createdAt` to align with Payments and Customer APIs. Retained per ARCH-4. */\n  readonly placedAt: string;\n  readonly channel: Channel;\n  readonly currency: string;\n  /** Integer, minor units. */\n  readonly amountCents: number;\n  /** @deprecated Renamed to `amountCents` to align with Payments and Customer APIs. Retained per ARCH-4. */\n  readonly totalCents: number;\n  readonly lines: ReadonlyArray<{\n    readonly sku: string;\n    readonly qty: number;\n    readonly unitPriceCents: number;\n  }>;\n}\n```\n\nWould you like to proceed with this ARCH-4 compliant additive deprecation path?\n",
